* ---- modulator top: sdm3 timing, 4-bit flash + behavioral DWA ----
* Nodes: TH0..TH14 = thermometer lines (H_i). External PUP clock (narrow
* pulse at PH1 rising edge) advances the DWA master register.
.subckt gf180_sdm3_mod_mb VINP VINN VCM_REF VP VN PH1 NPH1 PH2 NPH2 CMPCK PUP VDD33 VSS TH0 TH1 TH2 TH3 TH4 TH5 TH6 TH7 TH8 TH9 TH10 TH11 TH12 TH13 TH14 TH15 TH16 TH17 TH18 TH19 TH20 TH21 TH22 TH23 TH24 TH25 TH26 TH27 TH28 TH29 TH30 params: RSET=25k CC=10p
