* int2 with swapped clock pins (samples PH2 / integrates PH1)
XINT2 O1N O1P VCM_REF VP VN O2P O2N PH2 NPH2 PH1 NPH1 VDD33 VSS S2L0 S2L1 S2L2 S2L3 S2L4 S2L5 S2L6 S2L7 S2L8 S2L9 S2L10 S2L11 S2L12 S2L13 S2L14 S2L15 S2L16 S2L17 S2L18 S2L19 S2L20 S2L21 S2L22 S2L23 S2L24 S2L25 S2L26 S2L27 S2L28 S2L29 S2L30 S2LN0 S2LN1 S2LN2 S2LN3 S2LN4 S2LN5 S2LN6 S2LN7 S2LN8 S2LN9 S2LN10 S2LN11 S2LN12 S2LN13 S2LN14 S2LN15 S2LN16 S2LN17 S2LN18 S2LN19 S2LN20 S2LN21 S2LN22 S2LN23 S2LN24 S2LN25 S2LN26 S2LN27 S2LN28 S2LN29 S2LN30 gf180_sdm3_int2_mb RSET={RSET} CC={CC}
