BCSUM CSUM 0 V=(v(THF0)+v(THF1)+v(THF2)+v(THF3)+v(THF4)+v(THF5)+v(THF6)+v(THF7)+v(THF8)+v(THF9)+v(THF10)+v(THF11)+v(THF12)+v(THF13)+v(THF14)+v(THF15)+v(THF16)+v(THF17)+v(THF18)+v(THF19)+v(THF20)+v(THF21)+v(THF22)+v(THF23)+v(THF24)+v(THF25)+v(THF26)+v(THF27)+v(THF28)+v(THF29)+v(THF30))/v(VDD33)
* DWA pointer: master samples mod(p_slave - c + 15) during PUP,
* slave tracks master during PH2. p[n+1]=(p[n]-c[n]) mod 31.
* B-source current sample/hold (idsw SW broke transient OP; RC form is OP-clean)
*
* int1 unit selects (straight thermometer): P-side unit j -> VP if j < 15-c.
* RC-smoothed current-source form (tau ~2 ns); sigmoid boundary errors
* cancel pairwise in the summed DAC charge.
BSEL0 SEL0 VSS I=(v(SEL0)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp((0+0.5-(31-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
BSELN0 SELN0 VSS I=(v(SELN0)-(v(VDD33)-v(SEL0)))/1k
BSEL1 SEL1 VSS I=(v(SEL1)-v(VDD33)/(1+exp((1+0.5-(31-v(CSUM)))/0.15)))/1k
